{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13203400","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13203400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1320340001:1":{"text":"쯧, 이 오지랖 넓은 놈들. 아직도 있었나?!","source_cn":"啧，你们这群多管闲事的家伙怎么还在？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1728B2E54513BCFB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320340002:1":{"text":"...또 당신이군요! 지난번에 시간을 더 준다고 했잖아요!","source_cn":"——又是你！上次来的时候，你不是答应我们多宽限一段时间吗？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E35CDE3B134D6BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320340003:1":{"text":"그래, 주기로 했었지. 하지만 얼마나 준다고는 말 안 했잖아.","source_cn":"是，我是答应了，但我可没说到底要宽限多久。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6599ED099F85043","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320340004:1":{"text":"이제 레프스키가 죽었으니 예브게니 영감이 언제 돈을 갚을지 아냐고!","source_cn":"现在列夫斯基死了，谁知道老叶甫根尼要拖到什么时候才肯还债！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF1F474C94E7C6DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1320340005:1":{"text":"더, 더 미루지 않겠습니다. 당장 일자리를 찾아서 돈을 벌고...","source_cn":"我、我不会再拖了！我明天就去找份活计挣钱——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F110DE0CBEEBEE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1320340006:1":{"text":"됐어! 나에게 진 빚이 얼만데 그걸 단번에 갚을 수 있을 것 같아? 도망가면 어쩌려고?","source_cn":"行了！你欠了那么多钱，怎么可能一时半会就全还上！万一你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FE9B415F89D9BE6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1320340007:1":{"text":"차라리 지금 당장 너를 내쫓고 이 집을 담보로 잡는 게 낫겠어!","source_cn":"依我看，倒不如现在就把你赶出去，拿这房子来抵债！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FC01B7AA48EB1C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320340008:1":{"text":"젠장, 당신 완전 날강도였군요!","source_cn":"可恶！你简直就是强盗——！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B66E269F6267817","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:讨债的商人":{"text":"빚을 독촉하는 상인","source":"讨债的商人","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:老叶甫根尼":{"text":"예브게니","source":"老叶甫根尼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":3}}